Description: LiteLLM integration for Puter AI - Unified AI Gateway
 LiteLLM Puter provides a unified gateway to access 488+ AI models
 through Puter's AI API. It supports models from:
  * OpenAI (GPT-4, GPT-5, o1, o3, o4)
  * Anthropic (Claude 3, 4, Opus)
  * DeepSeek (chat, reasoner)
  * xAI (Grok 2, 3)
  * Google Gemini
  * Mistral AI
  * And many more via OpenRouter and Together AI
 .
 This package includes a systemd service for running the gateway
 as a background service.
